  ],
  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I'd barely seen you when you asked me if I hated you",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Wasn't surprised but still had nothing I could say to you",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "I'm sorry if I ever made you feel the way you do",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "pre-chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Yeah, I know I know you better than your parents",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "I heard about 'em, you don't gotta be embarrassed",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "You go online 'cause that's where you can be the saddest",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "You've been acting careless",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Know you put on a happy face",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "You need someone who's gonna stay",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "I know you're crushed under the weight",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Wanna hold you up, wanna hold you up",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "You keep things bottled up inside",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "I wish you'd give someone a try",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "You fell apart a million times",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Wanna hold you up, wanna hold you up",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Before my heart gives out",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_3",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "You're losing track of all the friends I know you used to have",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Don't know what happened but the old you wasn't half as bad",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "I'm sorry no one sees what's going on inside your head",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
